# Versification "Bible Strong GW": an overlay on bs-eng, for GOD'S WORD Translation.
#
# 2 Corinthians 13 has 13 verses, as in org: GW 13:12 holds the holy kiss and the greeting of the
# saints, 13:13 the blessing.
2CO 13:13
2CO 13:13 = 2CO 13:13
#
# GW prints four rows that stand for two verses, stored on the first number; the second number
# has no row. Exodus 27:14 and 38:14 ("Each side ⌞of the entrance⌟ will be 22½ feet wide…") are
# verses 14-15; Numbers 4:47 holds the total of 4:48; Jeremiah 27:19 holds 27:20.
EXO 27:14 = EXO 27:14-15
EXO 38:14 = EXO 38:14-15
NUM 4:47 = NUM 4:47-48
JER 27:19 = JER 27:19-20
